WEBVTT

00:10.960 --> 00:12.710
This is how I'll become...

00:15.630 --> 00:17.250
This is how I'll become...

00:19.460 --> 00:21.250
...Supreme Commander.

00:21.630 --> 00:22.960
...a hero.

00:23.380 --> 00:25.000
This is my story!

01:56.630 --> 02:00.330
<b>Reunion, Coco, Lick</b>

02:08.880 --> 02:09.670
Yuuki!

02:10.290 --> 02:11.130
On it!

02:24.630 --> 02:27.420
Good. We put them in their place.

02:34.420 --> 02:35.750
Well spotted.

02:38.670 --> 02:40.330
Attaboy, Yuuki.

02:41.670 --> 02:43.000
She complimented me!

02:43.000 --> 02:44.250
This is great!

02:44.250 --> 02:46.630
At this rate, I'm bound to get stronger!

02:47.040 --> 02:50.710
If I'm lucky, I'll get strong enough
to protect Miss Kyouka!

02:54.290 --> 02:57.830
So, what kind of reward
is this supposed to be?

02:58.420 --> 03:00.630
I haven't sustained any injuries,
you know.

03:00.630 --> 03:02.670
I-I'm not so sure myself!

03:03.960 --> 03:05.670
It's an appropriate reward for Nei,

03:05.670 --> 03:08.630
but doing this type of thing with me
is a waste of time.

03:08.630 --> 03:10.040
Huh? No way!

03:10.250 --> 03:12.500
That couldn't be further from the truth!

03:13.540 --> 03:14.960
If you say so...

03:14.960 --> 03:17.500
I simply don't understand
your appetites...

03:18.040 --> 03:19.250
pervert.

03:24.670 --> 03:25.630
Wow...

03:25.630 --> 03:27.880
Our Yukki's making more progress!

03:27.880 --> 03:29.960
He follows my orders to a T,

03:29.960 --> 03:33.080
seeking out the most efficient method
on his own before taking action.

03:33.080 --> 03:34.830
That's fantastic, Mr. Yuuki!

03:34.830 --> 03:36.540
Oh, it's nothing...

03:37.790 --> 03:41.080
Aw, you're so adorable
when you blush, little slave.

03:41.080 --> 03:43.130
M-Miss Tenka!

03:43.790 --> 03:47.630
Commander Izumo, shouldn't you be
heading back to your dorm?

03:47.630 --> 03:49.170
It'll be fine.

03:49.170 --> 03:51.790
You really are incredible, aren't you?

03:51.790 --> 03:53.540
Have you always been this talented?

03:53.540 --> 03:55.580
Hey, knock it off!

03:58.960 --> 04:01.420
W-well, I don't know about that...

04:01.420 --> 04:05.040
but my big sister taught me
a lot when I was young...

04:05.040 --> 04:06.250
Big sister?

04:06.250 --> 04:09.790
Oh yeah, you said your sister
was pretty cool, right?

04:09.790 --> 04:11.960
Oh? You must really admire her.

04:11.960 --> 04:12.750
I do.

04:12.750 --> 04:15.460
Really? What was she like?

04:28.580 --> 04:30.000
Yo, Wakura!

04:30.000 --> 04:32.750
I don't appreciate you always ignoring me.

04:32.750 --> 04:34.210
You think I'm stupid?

04:34.210 --> 04:36.750
It's 'cause you're always saying
mean things to me!

04:38.920 --> 04:41.750
C'mon, kid. Play nice with my brother.

04:44.580 --> 04:46.830
Get your hands off my brother!

04:52.130 --> 04:53.540
This your sister?

05:03.080 --> 05:04.880
Yuuki! Are you-

05:08.960 --> 05:11.920
I learned a move or two from playing
pro wrestler with you, Big Sis!

05:11.920 --> 05:14.250
I'm not a wimp, okay?!

05:16.580 --> 05:18.750
THAT'S my precious little brother!

05:18.750 --> 05:20.170
You get an A+!

05:21.500 --> 05:23.130
You'll regret this!

05:23.130 --> 05:24.830
This calls for a celebration!

05:25.330 --> 05:27.790
Let's go get a treat, on me!

05:27.790 --> 05:30.460
<b>Ramen</b>

05:33.830 --> 05:36.000
That's just the way she was.

05:36.000 --> 05:38.250
She sounds like a good sister.

05:38.250 --> 05:40.880
She was training you,
and you didn't even know it.

05:40.880 --> 05:44.210
Younger siblings sure do
have it rough, don't they?

05:44.210 --> 05:46.670
We figured out what makes Yukki tick!

05:47.750 --> 05:50.380
Take the rest of the evening off, Yuuki.

05:50.380 --> 05:52.710
Okay. I'll take a bath
then get some shut-eye.

05:52.710 --> 05:54.420
And go home, Tenka.

05:55.170 --> 05:56.920
I suppose it's getting late.

05:57.960 --> 05:59.540
Catch you later, little slave.

06:08.750 --> 06:12.290
All this talk of big sisters
is making Nei jealous!

06:12.540 --> 06:14.960
So we're the only ones without siblings.

06:14.960 --> 06:19.170
I was the youngest in my family,
but everyone liked to spoil me.

06:19.170 --> 06:21.080
Yeah, that checks out.

06:23.380 --> 06:24.960
I'm detecting someone in danger!

06:24.960 --> 06:26.380
Four kilometers south!

06:26.380 --> 06:28.290
Himari, Shushu. On the double!

06:28.290 --> 06:29.250
Yes, ma'am!

06:49.330 --> 06:50.790
DDF in the house!

06:50.790 --> 06:52.170
You can relax now!

07:00.710 --> 07:01.880
Are you okay?

07:02.170 --> 07:03.170
Yeah...

07:05.540 --> 07:07.210
Thanks for that!

07:11.000 --> 07:12.420
Himarin!

07:12.420 --> 07:15.130
Coco knows how to pack a punch...

07:15.670 --> 07:17.880
I caught some Demon Defense Force!

07:18.920 --> 07:21.830
Now, let's make 'em suffer.

07:22.290 --> 07:23.670
Another humanoid?!

07:23.670 --> 07:24.750
Bring it on!

07:24.750 --> 07:26.880
I'll blast ya into next week!

07:26.880 --> 07:28.540
Himarin, you good?

07:28.540 --> 07:29.630
Yup...

07:30.920 --> 07:32.670
Blocked it in the nick of time.

07:33.750 --> 07:35.920
Oh, not bad.

07:42.880 --> 07:43.790
Stop!

07:43.790 --> 07:44.580
Huh?

07:44.710 --> 07:46.630
Your name's Coco, right?

07:47.080 --> 07:47.960
Wha-?

07:47.960 --> 07:49.880
How did you know that?

07:49.880 --> 07:52.290
Wait a minute...
Is that your Peach ability?

07:52.580 --> 07:56.210
No, you literally said,
"Coco knows how to pack a punch."

07:57.000 --> 07:59.330
The Supreme Commander
of the Demon Defense Force

07:59.330 --> 08:01.210
is willing to negotiate with your kind!

08:01.210 --> 08:02.420
Will you hear us out?

08:03.210 --> 08:04.580
Dream on!

08:04.580 --> 08:06.420
I'm gonna crush you!

08:08.420 --> 08:10.500
Cuts and bruises all over...

08:10.500 --> 08:13.500
We've been fighting Shuuki
left and right lately.

08:14.380 --> 08:17.080
At least my muscles
are coming along nicely!

08:17.080 --> 08:20.130
Keep getting those gains, my dude!

08:20.130 --> 08:20.960
I'm coming in!

08:21.790 --> 08:23.000
Miss Kyouka?!

08:23.380 --> 08:25.290
We're under attack. You need to transform!

08:25.540 --> 08:27.750
Huh? Like, right now?

08:27.750 --> 08:30.460
Get a move on!
Shushu and Himari are in trouble!

08:36.380 --> 08:38.830
It's strong! My bullets can't pierce it!

08:38.830 --> 08:42.460
Whaddya think?
Kuma's got mega-tough armor!

08:42.460 --> 08:43.330
Huh?

08:46.420 --> 08:48.750
I can adapt too, y'know!

08:58.250 --> 08:59.330
Cancel ability!

09:04.210 --> 09:06.330
A real live free-for-all...

09:06.330 --> 09:07.920
This oughtta be fun!

09:07.920 --> 09:09.630
Take this!

09:11.790 --> 09:14.000
Nice! Wiped out all the pint-sized Shuuki.

09:14.000 --> 09:16.130
Just need to back up Himarin...

09:26.670 --> 09:28.880
It's... wielding a weapon?

09:50.130 --> 09:51.130
It's her...

09:54.920 --> 09:56.710
You came out to play.

10:10.250 --> 10:11.210
Dodge it!

10:12.580 --> 10:14.420
YUUKI, QUIT MOVING!

10:14.670 --> 10:15.630
Yes, ma'am!

10:22.170 --> 10:23.290
Yuuki!

10:24.130 --> 10:25.790
Objective complete.

10:28.920 --> 10:29.960
Out of my way!

10:42.630 --> 10:45.210
They... vanished?

10:51.000 --> 10:52.210
For real?

10:53.960 --> 10:55.210
They took him?

10:56.080 --> 10:59.130
Yuuki must've been their target
from the very beginning.

11:00.130 --> 11:03.170
That explains why the humanoids
showed up only to retreat.

11:03.170 --> 11:05.290
They already accomplished their goal...

11:07.250 --> 11:08.500
Yuuki...

11:09.000 --> 11:10.130
Commander!

11:10.670 --> 11:12.210
Let's head back to the dorm.

11:15.710 --> 11:18.080
Your wounds need medical attention first.

11:18.080 --> 11:21.040
We'll take a quick breather and regroup.

11:33.710 --> 11:35.920
Big... Sis?

11:43.580 --> 11:45.830
Big Sis...

11:46.830 --> 11:50.290
Hm? That feels really good...

11:55.880 --> 11:56.790
Wha-?!

11:58.330 --> 12:01.000
Settle down and lie still.

12:03.040 --> 12:05.500
You'll be better in no time,
so bear with me, 'kay?

12:09.750 --> 12:12.920
That's right...
I remember getting captured...

12:13.040 --> 12:15.830
And now I've woken up to the enemy
licking my whole body...

12:17.000 --> 12:18.630
Wait, first things first.

12:18.630 --> 12:21.580
During the fight,
when she yelled my name...

12:22.750 --> 12:23.960
I knew it!

12:23.960 --> 12:25.830
That WAS my sister!

12:25.830 --> 12:26.830
Hey, uh-

12:28.960 --> 12:30.040
Stop squirmin'!

12:30.040 --> 12:31.500
I'm trying to be thorough here!

12:31.500 --> 12:35.790
A-am I... being assaulted by the enemy?!

12:35.790 --> 12:37.080
What do I do?!

12:37.080 --> 12:38.420
All righty!

12:38.420 --> 12:40.210
Looks like we're in the clear!

12:40.210 --> 12:42.380
How's Yuuki? Is he awake?

12:45.960 --> 12:47.000
Big Sis Aoba!

12:47.000 --> 12:48.960
You're just in time for-

12:49.790 --> 12:51.460
I surrender! I surrender!

12:51.460 --> 12:54.920
What in the world possessed you
to strip my brother naked?!

12:55.580 --> 12:58.080
Such an ugly misunderstanding...

12:59.130 --> 13:02.670
He was naked
when his transformation was broken.

13:02.670 --> 13:05.000
And he had several injuries.

13:05.000 --> 13:07.380
That's why Coco was healing him.

13:07.380 --> 13:09.380
Beauty of the self-sacrificing sort.

13:09.380 --> 13:11.580
I did it 'cause he's your brother...

13:11.790 --> 13:14.460
I wanted to get every last scratch on him.

13:14.750 --> 13:17.790
Now that you mention it,
they're all gone.

13:18.130 --> 13:21.630
It's my saliva...
It's got medicinal properties.

13:21.630 --> 13:24.130
She did say you'd be better in no time.

13:25.960 --> 13:27.750
Aw, my bad, Coco!

13:27.750 --> 13:29.000
And thanks!

13:29.000 --> 13:30.790
I'll treat you to something yummy!

13:30.790 --> 13:32.330
Yay!

13:32.670 --> 13:34.210
I know that personality...

13:34.540 --> 13:36.080
It really IS you!

13:44.540 --> 13:46.130
It's been a while!

13:46.130 --> 13:48.170
You're all grown up now, Yuuki!

13:54.580 --> 13:58.330
You were alive... the whole time.

13:59.710 --> 14:01.960
You can't get rid of me that easily!

14:02.630 --> 14:03.830
Big Sis...

14:05.920 --> 14:07.790
I guess it all worked out!

14:07.790 --> 14:10.880
Sibling love... It's a beautiful thing.

14:10.880 --> 14:13.580
I almost forgot!
Why do you look like that?

14:13.580 --> 14:15.630
You're the one not wearing pants.

14:17.500 --> 14:19.630
My, my. You really have grown.

14:19.630 --> 14:22.040
<b>AOBA WAKURA</b>

14:22.630 --> 14:24.420
Go ahead and put these on.

14:24.420 --> 14:26.290
Then let's take a walk outside.

14:26.290 --> 14:29.500
Where we are, what we are...

14:29.500 --> 14:31.290
It'd be faster just to show you.

14:38.880 --> 14:40.460
Whoa...

14:47.960 --> 14:51.330
We refer to it as a "hidden village."

14:51.330 --> 14:53.790
There aren't any Peach trees in the area,

14:53.790 --> 14:56.630
so the Demon Defense Force
doesn't come poking around out here.

15:00.710 --> 15:03.290
There are others who look just like you.

15:03.290 --> 15:07.960
About twenty people call this place home.
All former humans like me.

15:07.960 --> 15:10.000
I'm Coco Zenibako.

15:10.210 --> 15:11.460
<b>COCO ZENIBAKO</b>

15:12.960 --> 15:14.460
Naon Yuno.

15:14.460 --> 15:16.380
<b>NAON YUNO</b>

15:17.750 --> 15:19.750
Shuuki used to be humans?!

15:19.750 --> 15:21.880
Those things are full-blooded monsters.

15:21.880 --> 15:23.880
We're a special case.

15:23.880 --> 15:27.580
It's a "half-human, half-monster"
kinda situation.

15:27.920 --> 15:30.330
An accident caused us to end up like this.

15:30.330 --> 15:33.790
But... our souls are still human.

15:36.380 --> 15:38.250
Pretty nice setup, right?

15:38.250 --> 15:40.710
You and I can live here together!

15:40.710 --> 15:41.500
Huh?

15:41.500 --> 15:42.710
Oh, don't worry!

15:42.710 --> 15:45.420
You won't have to deal with
being treated like a slave anymore.

15:45.710 --> 15:47.500
Whoa, slow down!

15:47.500 --> 15:49.500
There's no reason for you
to hide, Big Sis!

15:49.500 --> 15:50.880
You're human!

15:52.580 --> 15:55.290
If you talk to the Demon Defense Force,
they'll protect you!

15:57.750 --> 15:59.250
That's not an option.

16:00.380 --> 16:02.580
The Demon Defense Force is our enemy!

16:04.540 --> 16:08.210
They enslaved you,
and with the way their hierarchy works,

16:08.210 --> 16:09.710
we cannot be allies.

16:10.920 --> 16:13.000
A battle is inevitable.

16:15.630 --> 16:18.170
They were friendly up until a minute ago.

16:20.380 --> 16:21.960
What the hell happened?!

16:25.920 --> 16:27.170
Ow-ow-ow!

16:27.580 --> 16:29.080
Are you okay?

16:29.080 --> 16:31.540
Luckily, the wound isn't very deep.

16:31.540 --> 16:33.130
I think this should fix it.

16:33.130 --> 16:35.210
Yeah, I feel just fine!

16:35.210 --> 16:38.670
Besides, I'm way more worried
about Yukki right now.

16:39.080 --> 16:41.080
I can't act like a whiny baby.

16:41.750 --> 16:43.540
Hey, Nei! You find him?!

16:46.170 --> 16:49.460
I asked the other squads
to help look for him, but...

16:49.790 --> 16:50.670
Oh...

16:50.670 --> 16:52.830
I'll try widening the search.

16:53.130 --> 16:54.250
Please do.

16:54.460 --> 16:56.540
What's the commander doing?

16:56.920 --> 17:00.130
She's been holed up inside her room
ever since we got back...

17:03.580 --> 17:06.670
She's currently under orders
from the Supreme Commander

17:06.670 --> 17:08.460
not to attack the humanoids, right?

17:08.830 --> 17:10.000
Maybe that's why...

17:10.000 --> 17:11.250
Yeah, but...

17:11.250 --> 17:13.710
While we're just sitting around,
Yukki might...

17:15.380 --> 17:19.580
The fact that they abducted him tells me
they've got a specific goal in mind.

17:19.920 --> 17:21.380
I'm sure he's safe.

17:21.380 --> 17:22.500
So don't worry!

17:22.500 --> 17:24.830
The commander will come up
with a plan of her own.

17:35.290 --> 17:37.210
Obeying someone other than his master?

17:37.210 --> 17:39.460
He's in trouble when he comes back.

17:56.380 --> 17:58.170
Um, Big Sis?

17:58.170 --> 18:00.830
How'd you know I was in Mato?

18:02.420 --> 18:04.790
I could sense
my little brother's presence here.

18:04.790 --> 18:06.330
You can do that?

18:06.330 --> 18:08.040
Of course. I'm your big sister!

18:08.330 --> 18:10.000
It's my job to be able to find you.

18:10.290 --> 18:14.960
And I didn't want to overinflate your ego,
so I kept my mouth shut back then,

18:14.960 --> 18:18.130
but you're all grown up now,
so I can shout it from the rooftops!

18:18.130 --> 18:20.330
You're a bona fide ultra-hottie, Yuuki!

18:20.330 --> 18:22.420
Wouldn't you two agree?!

18:23.750 --> 18:24.830
Yup.

18:25.500 --> 18:26.380
Sure do.

18:26.670 --> 18:27.920
Hell yeah!

18:29.040 --> 18:30.880
Sorry about her...

18:35.000 --> 18:37.040
I'll go and get you some food.

18:37.040 --> 18:37.880
Big Sis-

18:41.000 --> 18:44.000
I know my sister can be
a little unorthodox sometimes.

18:44.000 --> 18:45.790
Is it hard working with her?

18:45.790 --> 18:47.580
"A little" is an understatement!

18:47.880 --> 18:50.960
Yes, but everyone here loves Aoba.

18:50.960 --> 18:52.710
Flaws and all.

18:58.130 --> 19:00.710
Whatever you've got there
smells delicious.

19:00.960 --> 19:03.830
We grow these Mato mushrooms
in the village.

19:03.830 --> 19:05.920
The flavor and aroma are immaculate.

19:05.920 --> 19:07.330
They're energizing, too.

19:08.170 --> 19:10.420
It smells sweet, like fruit juice.

19:10.420 --> 19:13.130
I wonder what ingredients
it'd pair well with...

19:14.420 --> 19:15.540
What's wrong?

19:16.630 --> 19:18.000
Oh dear...

19:18.380 --> 19:21.290
Despite the accident,
I take great pride in my beauty.

19:21.290 --> 19:23.960
Has Naon Yuno mesmerized you
with her looks?

19:26.250 --> 19:27.580
Are you all right?

19:28.750 --> 19:30.500
Oh, Big Sis...

19:32.040 --> 19:35.330
You brought me some tasty meat buns!

19:35.330 --> 19:37.210
Time to dig in!

19:37.210 --> 19:39.790
These are just field rations I swiped
from the Demon Defense Force,

19:39.790 --> 19:41.670
but for now, it ought to be...

19:42.960 --> 19:44.960
Mm, what a nice texture!

19:44.960 --> 19:46.460
Hey, quit-

19:46.460 --> 19:49.130
How does this happen
when I take my eyes off you?

19:53.880 --> 19:55.210
Prepare for a sortie!

19:55.210 --> 19:57.580
Does this mean you figured out
where Yukki is?

19:57.580 --> 20:00.250
My body began moving automatically.

20:01.170 --> 20:02.040
Which implies...

20:02.040 --> 20:03.170
It's Yuuki!

20:03.170 --> 20:05.290
His transformation must've broken!

20:05.540 --> 20:08.080
I get it! The price of your ability!

20:08.670 --> 20:10.500
If I have to give him a reward,

20:10.500 --> 20:13.710
that makes me a living, breathing
Yuuki Detection Radar!

20:16.540 --> 20:18.420
Are you feeling better now?

20:18.920 --> 20:19.670
Yeah...

20:20.000 --> 20:21.630
Sorry, Big Sis.

20:23.080 --> 20:24.130
Big Sis?

20:25.080 --> 20:27.290
It felt like old times
for a second there...

20:28.330 --> 20:31.630
I think the fact that you're actually
sitting next to me finally sunk in.

20:32.210 --> 20:33.330
Big Sis...

20:34.830 --> 20:38.040
Speaking of which,
that's a Mato Peach, isn't it?

20:38.210 --> 20:39.170
Uh-huh.

20:39.170 --> 20:41.960
You hadn't eaten one
back before we were separated, right?

20:41.960 --> 20:43.210
Can you blame me?

20:43.210 --> 20:45.670
Between the procedures and the paperwork,
it was a huge headache.

20:46.000 --> 20:48.920
Quite a few people
choose not to eat them, y'know.

20:49.130 --> 20:50.830
Ah. It's just...

20:50.830 --> 20:54.880
I had assumed your powers
were a direct result of the Peaches.

20:55.830 --> 20:58.080
There IS a connection between them.

21:00.210 --> 21:04.000
In fact, the Peaches are what caused us
to look like this.

21:05.500 --> 21:07.210
I want to hear the whole story!

21:09.250 --> 21:13.210
You stay here, Nei.
Keep in contact with HQ for us.

21:13.880 --> 21:16.170
If something should happen,
let me know immediately.

21:16.170 --> 21:17.540
Just leave it to me!

21:34.210 --> 21:36.500
We're a united front. Now let's move!

23:11.040 --> 23:15.500
<b>TEACH US! NEI-SENPAI!</b>

23:11.380 --> 23:12.920
"Teach Us! Nei-senpai!"

23:12.920 --> 23:13.540
Okey-dokey!

23:13.540 --> 23:15.500
Today, I'll be explaining more
about the Demon Defense Force.

23:15.500 --> 23:17.790
The Demon Defense Force was established
by the government as a highly trained

23:15.500 --> 23:32.710
<b>MATO SPECIAL DEFENSE FORCES</b>

23:17.790 --> 23:20.210
military unit that may only exercise the
use of force within the confines of Mato.

23:20.210 --> 23:23.000
It's officially named the
Mato Special Defense Forces.

23:23.000 --> 23:26.000
Only women endowed with the benefits
of the Peaches are permitted to join,

23:26.000 --> 23:28.790
and in addition to active combat,
there are plenty of roles to be filled,

23:28.790 --> 23:30.580
some of which create "armor"
out of Peach abilities,

23:30.580 --> 23:32.170
like how Nei gathers intel!

23:32.170 --> 23:33.630
It's an extremely difficult job,

23:33.630 --> 23:36.580
but it comes with the honor of being able
to rescue lots of people from danger!

23:36.710 --> 23:37.540
